      },
      {
        "text": "The committee has enough votes to pass the death penalty repeal.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Tyra Patterson was wrongly convicted and was not on death row.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The full legislature likely has enough votes to pass the death penalty repeal.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes their change of heart resulted from personal growth and experiences.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The main obstacle to passage is whether the 14th floor will permit it.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
