      },
      {
        "text": "The only two remaining methods of execution that may not clearly violate the Eighth Amendment are hanging and shooting.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The general public would not accept hanging or shooting as forms of execution.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
